1. libheif-js 1.23.5 (LGPL-3.0)
   An Emscripten build of libheif (https://github.com/strukturag/libheif,
   LGPL-3.0). Used only by qyMaker to decode HEIC/HEIF photos.
   Source and license: https://github.com/catdad-experiments/libheif-js
   The library is shipped as separate files (libheif.js and libheif.wasm) and
   is loaded only when a HEIC photo is imported; it is not merged into the
   application code. The qyPlayer source in this repository is the
   corresponding application source, and the dependency is pinned in
   pnpm-lock.yaml, so you can rebuild the application with a modified
   libheif-js.

2. mediabunny 1.66.0 (MPL-2.0)
   Used by qyMaker to read, transcode and mux audio and video, and to export
   MP4. Source and license: https://github.com/Vanilagy/mediabunny
   The files of mediabunny are used unmodified.

